<title>UK: Coca-Cola Amatil sets $300 mln five-year bond. [CORRECTED 08:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Amatil sets $300 mln five-year bond. [CORRECTED 08:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COCA-COLA AMATIL LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    28.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.127   PAY DATE    28.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.527    SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects Full Fees from 1.625)</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT APRIL 2002</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
